1
00:00:00,600 --> 00:00:02,422
This is Margaret.

2
00:00:02,272 --> 00:00:06,462
For thirty-one years, she's been the first face you see at Hartley and Co.

3
00:00:06,800 --> 00:00:08,738
She knows everyone's birthday.

4
00:00:08,588 --> 00:00:10,746
Remembers how you take your tea.

5
00:00:10,596 --> 00:00:11,966
And next Friday…

6
00:00:11,816 --> 00:00:13,080
she retires.

7
00:00:13,500 --> 00:00:16,227
Priya wants to do something special.

8
00:00:16,077 --> 00:00:18,166
But half the team works from home.

9
00:00:18,016 --> 00:00:20,035
Some left years ago.

10
00:00:19,885 --> 00:00:21,266
And the envelope?

11
00:00:21,116 --> 00:00:23,542
It never makes it past the second floor.

12
00:00:23,900 --> 00:00:26,384
So she starts a Collection Pot.

13
00:00:26,234 --> 00:00:27,150
One link

14
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:33,106
dropped in the team chat, emailed to old colleagues, even taped up at reception as a QR code.

15
00:00:33,500 --> 00:00:36,053
Then the messages start pouring in.

16
00:00:35,903 --> 00:00:37,272
From the Leeds office.

17
00:00:37,122 --> 00:00:38,561
From kitchen tables.

18
00:00:38,411 --> 00:00:40,988
From people she hadn't seen in a decade.

19
00:00:41,400 --> 00:00:43,547
“You made my first day less scary.”

20
00:00:43,800 --> 00:00:45,761
“You never forgot my kids' names.”

21
00:00:46,000 --> 00:00:48,054
“The office won't be the same without you.”

22
00:00:48,700 --> 00:00:51,346
On Friday, Margaret opens her Pot.

23
00:00:51,196 --> 00:00:52,554
The gift was lovely.

24
00:00:52,404 --> 00:00:54,794
But it was the messages she read twice.

25
00:00:55,600 --> 00:00:57,074
Collection Pot.

26
00:00:56,924 --> 00:00:59,279
Collect together, celebrate together.
